From e5c53e73bbf8496703b4f1bc90ae52bc3eb5f8a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:55:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OB-6: Unified Knowledge Access (KNOW) through the existing
 read path

- retrieveRelevantSituation gains a time lens (current/history/reason) and a
  source scope; items carry the source's own temporal fields. New collectors
  read owners it never read: Events, Visual maps, the Board's view, member
  decisions at any scope, Business Understanding history and reasons.
- Business Understanding: supersedesId / changeReason / confirmedAt now pass
  through the read path (were dropped); retired offers never read as current;
  prices read as 'price: $49', not JSON.
- One Brain KNOW (knowQuestion.ts + know.ts): understand the question, read
  through the shared path (plus the Strategy Chamber's own store and the
  Living Model projection), derive truth types, apply fixed precedence and
  answer; capability selection yields so no room opens.
- Conversation Gate: temporal / Board / event / visual labels, recorded
  reasons, and a deterministic precedence line for the model.
- Five partial returns connected (Avatar, LMC, Events, Strategy, Visual).
- Visual Thinking receives the conversation through the studio's own
  source intake (same mechanism as the Research bridge).
- Who-knows-what from the Board / Chamber / Strategy selectors; director
  expertise in self-knowledge; honest 'not yet' from the availability map.
- Certification: know.ob6 (50); pinned OB-5 gaps updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0162D2EyVC24X9wVgoMdDuJm
